1
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,974
Hi. Hi, yeah. I'm on the train.

2
00:01:05,138 --> 00:01:06,750
Just leaving the office now.

3
00:01:19,404 --> 00:01:21,750
Long day. The Henley account. Again.

4
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,500
Was that the brakes?

5
00:01:35,913 --> 00:01:37,900
No, don't wait up. Love you.

6
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Yeah?

7
00:02:10,181 --> 00:02:11,750
I'm at the library, Mum.

8
00:02:18,952 --> 00:02:22,000
No, that's — it's the library. They're doing work on the —

9
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,000
<i>Kai?</i>

10
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,400
<i>Kai?</i>

11
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,500
What — where did he —

12
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Hey.

13
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Hey!

14
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,500
That's insane.

15
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,500
My name is Noor.

16
00:03:31,048 --> 00:03:32,600
My name is S—

17
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,000
<i>Kai?</i>

18
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:14,500
<i>Kai?</i>

19
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,000
You okay?

20
00:04:41,499 --> 00:04:42,500
I'm f—

21
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,600
I'm not fine.

22
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:51,759
Me neither. I haven't slept in two days.

23
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,148
You've seen this before.

24
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,564
I ride it every night.

25
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Why?

26
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:17,416
My wife was ill a long time. Everyone told me she'd be fine.
Doctors. Her sister. Me, to her.

27
00:05:20,016 --> 00:05:23,407
This is the only place nobody can say that to me.

28
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,250
Nobody said anything.

29
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,553
It isn't only what you say.

30
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:46,250
Whatever it is, say it.

31
00:06:53,474 --> 00:06:55,000
- I can't —
- Say it.

32
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,000
He's asking.

33
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:24,500
Mark.

34
00:07:25,565 --> 00:07:28,750
No. Listen. I'm not leaving the office.

35
00:07:31,575 --> 00:07:36,750
I haven't been to the office since September. They let me go. The whole floor.

36
00:07:42,009 --> 00:07:45,846
I get dressed and I get on the train and I go to the library —

37
00:07:46,046 --> 00:07:49,750
— and I sit there. All day. And then I come home.

38
00:07:56,361 --> 00:07:59,700
I didn't tell you because you'd have been kind about it, and I couldn't —

39
00:08:10,033 --> 00:08:11,033
I'm sorry.

40
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,932
<i>Thank you for riding quietly.</i>
